QuestGuidance.Register("en",88,{
[2785]="7002B6DB\n1\tFind the Ring-forge of Orthanc\tFind the Ring-forge of Orthanc.\n2\tDestroy the Ring-forge of Orthanc before defeating its protectors\tDestroy the Ring-forge of Orthanc before defeating its protectors. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[2786]="7001ECE2\n1\tDefeat Durchest and all ten of his guards\tDurchest and his ten guards loom within sinister Barad Guldur. You must engage in battle with Durchest, defeat each of his ten guards, and finally muster your remaining strength to slay Durchest himself.\n",
[2787]="70025384\n1\tFind the leader of the mercenary band\tFind the location of the mercenary leader.\n2\tDefeat Dale Truitt and Búbhosh-grat within 10 seconds of each other\tDefeat the leaders of the mercenary band. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[2788]="700255E0\n1\tLocate the source of the noxious fumes\tWithin Northcotton Farm, there is an odour most foul in the air. Discover the source of the foul odour.\n2\tDo not quench the fire while defeating Úmheryn\tThadúr the Ravager has nearly completed his fiendish experiments within the remnants of the Northcotton Farm. The virulent poison that he has concocted would be devastating to the hobbits that dwell around the farm. You must not waste a moment. Do not douse the fire beneath the cauldron with the bucket, in order to ensure the poison cauldron is destroyed as quickly as possible. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n3\tDefeat Thadúr the Ravager\tAfter successfully destroying the remains of Dark Thorn, Thadúr the Ravager will be forced to face you directly. Confront Thadúr the Ravager and purge his presence from the Northcotton Farm.\n",
[2789]="70037E08\n1\tDefeat the Uruk Warleader\tThe Uruk Warleader patrols around Lufût-mos at the Fords of Isen, far to the west of the Westfold. You should defeat the Uruk Warleader. WARNING: This quest is intended to be challenging.\n2\tDefeat the Uruk Warleader\tThe Uruk Warleader patrols around Lufût-mos at the Fords of Isen, far to the west of the Westfold. You should defeat the Uruk Warleader. WARNING: This quest is intended to be challenging.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated the mighty Uruk Warleader.\n",
[2790]="7001E682\n1\tDefeat the Warden of the Dungeons of Dol Guldur\030Save most of the prisoners from the Warden\tMany prisoners are trapped deep within the Dungeons of Dol Guldur. You should save as many prisoners as you can while you engage in battle with the Warden of the Dungeons.\n",
[2791]="7004E1AF\n1\tComplete \"The Perfect Picnic\" without losing any food items\tComplete \"The Perfect Picnic\" without losing any food items.\n2\tComplete \"The Perfect Picnic\" without losing any food items.\t\n",
[2792]="7004E1AC\n1\tComplete \"The Perfect Picnic\" without losing any food items\tComplete \"The Perfect Picnic\" without losing any food items.\n2\tComplete \"The Perfect Picnic\" without losing any food items.\t\n",
[2793]="7004E1AE\n1\tComplete \"The Perfect Picnic\" without losing any food items\tComplete \"The Perfect Picnic\" without losing any food items.\n2\tComplete \"The Perfect Picnic\" without losing any food items.\t\n",
[2794]="7002497D\n1\tReach the source of the poisoned waters\tDeep beyond the diseased infestation lies the source of the poison waters. Once you find it, make sure each safe location is occupied by a hero of the Free Peoples.\n2\tDefeat Frothmar\tContinue to occupy and defend each safe location with a hero of the Free Peoples. All safe locations must survive the battle. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[2795]="700459BD\n1\tConfront the Mûmakil of Harad\tThe Mûmakil of Harad have proven to be brutal foes and have claimed the lives of many, including Duilin and Derufin. They must be defeated before any more can succumb to their heavy footfalls.\n2\tDo not allow anyone to be defeated before defeating the Mûmakil\tThe Mûmakil of Harad have proven to be brutal foes and have claimed the lives of many, including Duilin and Derufin. They must be defeated before any more can succumb to their heavy footfalls. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[2796]="7001ECE0\n1\tDefeat the twins of Fire and Shadow within ten seconds of one another\tThe twin fiends of Fire and Shadow are in Barad Guldur. You must successfully engage and defeat the twin enemies of Fire and Shadow within Barad Guldur within ten seconds of one another.\n",
[2797]="700459BF\n1\tConfront the Black Númenórean binders\tThe Black Númenóreans of Minas Morgul twist and corrupt the vile creatures they have discovered in the depths of Middle-earth. You must purge their corruption from the mightiest of their captives before defeating the rest.\n2\tPurge the Unbroken One of corruption before defeating the Broken\tThe Black Númenóreans of Minas Morgul twist and corrupt the vile creatures they have discovered in the depths of Middle-earth. You must purge their corruption from the mightiest of their captives before defeating the rest. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[2798]="70022489\n1\tEngage Dolvaethor\tDolvaethor is awaiting you at the ancient tomb of Haudh Valandil.\n2\tDefeat Valandil and Dolvaethor within 10 seconds of each other\tDolvaethor has brought Valandil back as a wight. If you are to be sure of their defeat, their demise must come in nearly the same moment.\n",
[2799]="700374ED\n1\tChallenge: Defeat warrior-trolls in Shatorthum (total: 6)\tStrong warrior-trolls can be found in the depths of Shatorthum. You should defeat the strong warrior-trolls, if you are able.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have defeated a number of the menacing warrior-trolls near Marton, weakening this particular force resting on its way to storm Helm's Deep.\n",
[2800]="70032BDC\n1\tBurn all of the webs and cocoons before defeating the Great Spider Dígelir\tBurn all of the webs and cocoons before defeating the Great Spider Dígelir. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n2\tDefeat Dígelir\tDefeat Dígelir.\n",
[2801]="700228C6\n1\tApproach Breosal and Zaudru\tBreosal and Zaudru are deep within the tunnels underneath Helegrod.\n2\tDefeat Breosal's allies\tBreosal has brought many allies with her, they will need to be eliminated.\n3\tLight the cocoons on fire\tLogs have started falling from the bonfires. They can be used to burn the cocoons and spider-nests surrounding this area. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n4\tDefeat Zaudru\030Defeat the Angmarim silk-spinners (total: 4)\tBurning the cocoons has angered Zaudru. She must now be vanquished.\n",
[2802]="7006447E\n1\tComplete 'The Fight for Carn Dûm (Daily)' (total: 4)\tThe Free Peoples of Middle-earth strive to wrest Carn Dûm from the Iron Crown and defeat them once and for all. NOTE: You must complete the quest 'The Fight for Carn Dûm (Daily)' to advance this quest.\n2\tTalk to Muirál at Bail Avarc\tMuirál can be found at Bail Avarc in Angmar. You have done much to aid those opposing the Iron Crown at Carn Dûm. You should talk to Muirál. NOTE: Bail Avarc can initially only be accessed via stable-master routes. Bail Avarc can be reached via the stable-masters at Esteldín, Gath Forthnír, and the stables of Rivendell.\n",
[2803]="7005B063\n1\tComplete Gundabad instances (total: 6)\tComplete instances in the Gundabad Instance Cluster for Zóva. Once discovered, use the Instance Finder to enter Gundabad Instances.\n2\tCompleted\tCompleted many Gundabad instances.\n",
[2804]="7006A248\n1\tComplete Umbar instances (total: 6)\tComplete Instances in the Umbar Instance Cluster for the Quartermaster. Use the Instance Finder to enter Umbar Instances.\n2\tCompleted\tCompleted many Umbar instances.\n",
[2805]="7006D714\n1\tComplete Ikorbân Valley instances (total: 6)\tComplete Instances in the Ikorbân Valley Cluster for the Quartermaster. Use the Instance Finder to enter Ikorbân Valley Instances.\n2\tCompleted\tCompleted many Ikorbân Valley instances.\n",
[2806]="7005112B\n1\tEnter the Wistmead wheat maze\tThe Wistmead wheat maze can be found in the Wistmead Harvest Festival space. Ermentrude Haybank has challenged you to get through the wheat maze, from start to finish, before the time runs out.\n2\tFind your way out before the time expires\tThe exit to the wheat maze is around here somewhere... or is it? You should try to find your way out of the wheat maze before the time runs out. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n3\tTalk to Ermentrude Haybank\tThe Wistmead wheat maze can be found in the Wistmead Harvest Festival space. You should talk to Ermentrude Haybank at the wheat maze entrance.\n",
