[2811]="70071B36\n1\tDefeat Ordâkhai at Kôth Rau (total: 8)\tYou should defeat Ordâkhai at their encampment at Kôth Rau to show them that their presence will not go unchallenged. Kôth Rau is located in southern An Shêru, at the source of the now-dried Usâl River.\n2\tCompleted\tYou defeated Ordâkhai at their encampment at Kôth Rau in southern An Shêru, located at the source of the now-dried Usâl River.\n",
[2812]="7000256A\n1\tBring Ronkûrz's mace to Hwati\030Claim one of Ronkûrz' maces\tRonkûrz, the champion of Maethad, can be found training Uruks within the the Orc encampment of Mor Maudhúl, north of Gabilshathûr, on the far side of the lake in Duvuinen. Once you have claimed one of Ronkûrz's maces, bring it back to Hwati in Gabilshathûr.\n",
[2813]="700174DA\n1\tTalk to Valthor at the Foundations of Stone\tValthor is encamped at the Foundations of Stone in Moria. You have been instructed to seek out the guidance of the champion Valthor.\n2\tTalk to Valthor at the Foundations of Stone\tValthor is encamped at the Foundations of Stone in Moria. You have been instructed to seek out the guidance of the champion Valthor.\n",
[2814]="7000006D\n1\tMeet Gwesgylliel for further Champion training\tGwesgylliel is at Lin Giliath in Meluinen in the North Downs. You have been told that the Elf-maiden Gwesgylliel, herself a mighty champion, desires to speak with you.\n2\tTalk to Gwesgylliel\tGwesgylliel is at Lin Giliath in Meluinen in the North Downs. You have been told that the Elf-maiden Gwesgylliel, herself a mighty champion, desires to speak with you.\n",
[2815]="70027B78\n1\tChallenge Mostun to combat and defeat him\030Challenge Gaenor to combat and defeat her\030Challenge Wundod to combat and defeat him\tHorns outside several dwellings in Tûr Morva will allow you to challenge the inhabitants to combat.\n2\tTalk to Théodred at the forward encampment in Tâl Methedras\tThéodred is at the forward encampment in Tâl Methedras. You have challenged and defeated three champions of the Falcon-clan and should now return to Théodred.\n",
[2816]="7002CA90\n1\tFind Gadda at the abandoned farm\tGadda and a small handful of men loyal to Stanric have escaped Stangard and set up camp at the little farmstead where you planted some hopeful seeds. You should find Gadda at the abandoned farm in the east of Eorlsmead.\n",
